message.content:
I plan to enhance the "Latest public update" callout on the homepage to show the most recent tweak as a preview. This will involve:
1. Changing index.html to add a placeholder span for the latest tweak.
2. Changing app.js to update that placeholder when the recent tweaks are loaded.
3. Updating MEMORY.md to record this change.

I have confirmed the plan. I will now write the changes to index.html, app.js, and MEMORY.md.

